func (a *App) seed(){ if len(a.s.SampleTypes)==0 { defs:=[]Obj{{"name":"Amber","qualifiedCollectorRequired":true,"requiredQualification":"Amber","containerType":"standard","temperatureMinC":2.0,"temperatureMaxC":25.0,"requiresCooledRoute":false,"batchingAllowed":true},{"name":"Indigo","qualifiedCollectorRequired":true,"requiredQualification":"Indigo","containerType":"indigo","temperatureMinC":2.0,"temperatureMaxC":25.0,"requiresCooledRoute":false,"batchingAllowed":true},{"name":"Frost","qualifiedCollectorRequired":true,"requiredQualification":"Frost","containerType":"cooled","temperatureMinC":2.0,"temperatureMaxC":8.0,"requiresCooledRoute":true,"batchingAllowed":true},{"name":"Pulse","qualifiedCollectorRequired":true,"requiredQualification":"Pulse","containerType":"priority","temperatureMinC":2.0,"temperatureMaxC":25.0,"requiresCooledRoute":false,"batchingAllowed":false}}; for _,x:=range defs{x["sampleTypeId"]=id(); x["incompatibleSampleTypes"]=[]any{}; a.s.SampleTypes[x["sampleTypeId"].(string)]=x} }; if len(a.s.Users)==0 {u:=Obj{"userId":id(),"username":getenv("ADMIN_USERNAME","admin"),"password":getenv("ADMIN_PASSWORD","admin"),"fullName":"Initial Administrator","roles":[]any{"administrator"},"qualifications":[]any{},"certifications":[]any{},"active":true,"available":true};a.s.Users[u["userId"].(string)]=u}; a.save() }
func getenv(k,d string)string{if x:=os.Getenv(k);x!=""{return x};return d}
